		<Formel></Formel>
		<SystemName>-</SystemName>
		<Name>
			<Text TI="">Compressor-off code</Text>
		</Name>
		<diskreterSW></diskreterSW>
		<analogerSWunten></analogerSWunten>
		<analogerSWoben></analogerSWoben>
		<SWE></SWE>
		<SWF></SWF>
		<Meldungstext>\T\L\B\K\ACompressor code 0:\L\S\K\N Compressor on (no shut-off condition detected).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 1:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (pressure in refrigerant circuit was or is too high).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 3:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (pressure in refrigerant circuit is too low).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 5:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (engine nor running or has been running for less than 2 s).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 6:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (compressor shut off by way of ECON function).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 7:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (voltage at terminal 15 too low,  ignition off or blower speed 0).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 8:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (measured ambient temperature was below + 2 °C and is still below + 5 °C).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 10:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (undervoltage)\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 11:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (coolant temperature too high, currently 118 °C).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 12:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (shut-off request from engine control unit via CAN)\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 13:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (overvoltage).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 14:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (the measured temperature downstream of the evaporator is too low).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 16:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (hardware fault).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 18:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (motor/compressor speed too low).
 Compressor code 23: Compressor off (no cold output request).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 24:\L\S\K\N Compressor off (via the data bus system a fault message for activation of the radiator fans was transmitted).\L\B\K\A
 Compressor code 28:\L\S\K\N Shut-off due to start/stop.</Meldungstext>
